{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將軍澳醫院病房變成溫馨證婚場地。醫管局九龍東醫院聯網昨日（3日）在社交網站發文，指將軍澳醫院一名晚期癌症病人婉芳，在院方的特別安排下，順利於病房內見證女兒 Cathy 舉行結婚儀式。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"792329158_1480965744062742_2548342655565450029_n.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026O5vq4tovAa1788490024.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"792329158_1480965744062742_2548342655565450029_n.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事發當日，婉芳悉心打扮出席，並溫柔地將女兒 Cathy 交託到準女婿 Curtis 手中。她深情叮囑 Curtis 要好好照顧女兒，感人表示：「你要對她好好，她是我的掌上明珠。」能夠親眼見證女兒出嫁，婉芳坦言內心已再無遺憾。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"791245955_1061721753504386_3510583972600953511_n.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202653kmVRAr0Y1788490032.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"791245955_1061721753504386_3510583972600953511_n.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">儀式期間，婉芳忍不住多次落下感動的淚水。在飲過一對新人親手遞上的敬茶後，婉芳露出甜笑，動容地道：「呢杯茶特別甜！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"792807168_1439324811393040_736815334714268243_n.jpeg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GezxQsAZQL1788490039.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"792807168_1439324811393040_736815334714268243_n.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T03:25:57.421451+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}